      "value": "So it seems it only works so long as the player capsule is visible over someone. For example, if you go to click someone through the here tab, usually the player capsule doesn't appear over them, but if you start cycling through users with the < & > selection arrows at the top of the QM user profile, the player capsule shows up over users and that's when you're able to use `Match Eye Height`.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
