  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-07-19T15:28:15.935Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nNormally when clicking on another user in VR with the QM being open or using the \"Select User\" button in Desktop you can easily match the Eye Height of them by pressing on \"Match Eye Height\".  \n\nThe \"Match Eye Height\" button does not work when opening another users profile by clicking on them in the Here Tab, doing so does nothing. (It does not matter if you click on their Icon or their Name)\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**  \n\n1. Go into an instance with other Users  \n\n2. Open your QM and go to the Here Tab  \n\n3. Click on the name or icon of someone who is a different size compared to you  \n\n4. Click on \"Match Eye Height\"  \n\nIf you do this you will notice that your height doesn't actually change.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nPressing on \"Match Eye Height\" should always work no matter what way you are opening a user profile.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/85p9jd.mp4",
